# Figentra Flow (MIT) publishes as @figentra-oss/flow to the Figentra registry's open scope first, read anonymously
# (owner, 2026-10-31: npmjs's `figentra` name is held for about 30 days); it goes to npmjs as `figentra-flow` later.
@figentra-oss:registry=https://npm.stackra.figentra.com/
# The @stackra scope resolves from the Stackra registry only (ADR 0453); never npmjs.
@stackra:registry=https://npm.stackra.figentra.com/
